$\\,$ $⟨a,a⟩$ is a non-negative real number, and $⟨a,a⟩=0$ if and only if $a=0.$\n\nFirst, we use the fact that the inner product over $C$ is linear in the first argument: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨4a-b,\\,c⟩ & =⟨4a,c⟩-⟨b,c⟩ \\\\  & =4⟨a,c⟩-⟨b,c⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we use the fact that the inner product over $C$ has conjugate symmetry: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4⟨a,c⟩-⟨b,c⟩ & =4\\overset{―}{⟨c,a⟩}-⟨b,c⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute the values for $⟨c,a⟩$ and $⟨b,c⟩:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{―}{⟨c,a⟩}-⟨b,c⟩ & =4\\overset{―}{(1-2\\text{i})}-(2+3\\text{i}) \\\\  & =4(1+2\\text{i})-(2+3\\text{i}) \\\\  & =4+8\\text{i}-2-3\\text{i} \\\\  & =2+5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186308214 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186308215 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186308216 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186308217 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1000 #edb/ref 17592186308218 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1041 "selection" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1104 #edb/ref 17592186308218 13194139534759 true] [17592186308213 1110 #uuid "e34b21cc-e704-5a61-9eb7-a3fda73d7473" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308214 1034 "5+2\\text{i}" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308214 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534759 true] [17592186308214 1111 #uuid "cf518d7a-01f5-50d2-b94f-65e8a488c869" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308215 1034 "5-3\\text{i}" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308215 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534759 true] [17592186308215 1111 #uuid "49b4ef0e-f1e5-54ed-ba18-bbe54250378c" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308216 1034 "10\\text{i}" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308216 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534759 true] [17592186308216 1111 #uuid "e1f74b48-910b-58f3-8e92-bba56a87d7ee" 13194139534759 true] [17592186308217 1034 "7\\text{i}" 1319413